{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_5_level_main_05-07_beg","groupId":"main_5","stageId":"main_05-07","title":"生死與共","storyCode":"5-7","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_05-07_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ad1f707c902eb96384e8ed0da65896610da664f98ec0fdbfc60fd474c72950e3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_emporium"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這是你今天第三次睡醒，早安老陳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我昏迷了多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"十幾秒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——星熊，讓開。我來切碎積石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，我不能讓。讓這麼一下，你我可能就都沒了。我不要緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的胳膊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"......你撐不了多久！至少有兩層樓的廢墟壓在你的盾上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用撐多久。現在你醒了就好辦了，蹲下，你要隨時準備好衝出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"無論有多重——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——只要能被我掀開——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"——就也沒多重！！啊啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，哈……哎呀，只是這樣推一下，這隻手臂竟然就真的不行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你又救了我一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪嗎，我救你的次數還少嗎？就別鄭重其事地說出來了，我聽著不舒服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我歇一會，我覺得全身骨頭都散了......偶爾也允許我動彈不得一回吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......該死，這樣還沒辦法幹掉近衛局嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"但敵人不允許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"這就沒辦法了。看來還是得勉強站起來動一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你快去整頓隊伍。別被這些人拖住腳步，他們就是幹這個的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得先處理掉他們也不遲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你就不能先去看還有什麼人受傷了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"然後留你一身傷，獨自面對整合運動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"老陳。你以為你在做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"兩年前在下水，你自己去追的匪首。我腿腳受了傷，但你很信任我，你留下我一個人戰鬥。你還記得嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"那次我追了他多長時間？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"三個小時。你可以信任我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"現在也一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，整合運動！一齊上吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可惡，居然挑釁我們！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我還能戰鬥。為什麼這次你要留在這裡，為什麼不去率隊奪回近衛局？這難道不才是首要任務嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"現在和三年前沒有區別，你依然扛著只有你才能做的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才在木禾倉庫也是，你什麼時候變得那麼婆媽？老陳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"我不覺得保護自己的同事不受暴徒侵害有什麼問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你變了。以前的你是更剛強的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把你丟在這裡？當然可以。只不過我以前權衡的是利弊，但現在，就像你說的那樣——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"把阿米婭他們留在廢城這件事，我也一樣感到......不適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們會嘗到感染者的憤怒的！上啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"也許我確實變了。時間久了，我對龍門的不滿越來越少，相信我的人也越來越多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不再僅僅是星熊督察了，你是我的朋友，我的搭檔，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"你的盾，你替我撐了這麼久；偶爾也要允許我做一回你的盾牌，星熊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"嘩。你說這話臉都不紅一下的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"char_010_chen","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口*。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，行吧。行啊，老陳，都聽你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_010_chen","aliases":["陳"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]}]}
